extends home.pug
block heading
  p.eyebrow Technical article fixture
block stream
  article.article-view
    header.article-header
      .post-labels
        a(href='/search/label/Cloud') Cloud Security
      h1.post-title A practical guide to strengthening cloud identity boundaries
      .byline
        span Fixture author
        time(datetime='2026-09-08') September 8, 2026
        span#reading-time(hidden)
      p.standfirst Synthetic technical content for responsive and interaction tests, not a published article.
    .post-body#article-body
      p This fixture exercises the theme stylesheet and script bundle. It does not interpret Blogger expressions.
      h2 Know the boundary
      p Start with the identities, resources and grants that define the system.
      .note
        strong Note:
        |  Prefer explicit grants over broad defaults.
      h3 Inspect the permissions
      pre
        code.language-bash= 'printf "%s\\n" "' + 'x'.repeat(240) + '"'
      h2 Validate the controls
      .warning
        strong Warning:
        |  Test changes in a non-production environment first.
      table
        caption Control verification matrix
        thead
          tr
            th(scope='col') Control
            th(scope='col') Expected result
        tbody
          tr
            td Least privilege
            td Unauthorized requests are rejected.
          tr
            td Audit trail
            td Events identify actor and resource.
      p
        a(href='https://fastcyberdefense.com/')= 'https://fastcyberdefense.com/' + 'long-path-'.repeat(20)
      blockquote Evidence matters more than a green badge.
      h3 Preserve the evidence
      p Store results with the tested commit and explain remaining gaps.
    .share-actions(aria-label='Share article')
      button#copy-link.js-control(type='button' hidden) Copy article link
      a(href='https://www.linkedin.com/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer') Share on LinkedIn
    aside.article-cta
      h2 Need help securing your organization?
      p Put knowledge into practice with Fast Cyber Defense.
      a(href='https://fastcyberdefense.com/') Explore FCD services
